Bundled lexical data
--------------------
The files

    inflector-core/src/main/resources/io/github/slayyyyer/morphex/inflector/lexicon-v2.tsv
    inflector-core/src/main/resources/io/github/slayyyyer/morphex/inflector/lexicon-membership-v2.bin

are generated from the English noun extract published by Kaikki.org, itself derived from
English Wiktionary by Wiktextract. That data is licensed under Creative Commons
Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 Unported (CC BY-SA 3.0):

    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/

Attribution: Wiktionary contributors, via Kaikki.org (Tatu Ylonen) and Wiktextract.
See data/LICENSE-DATA.md for the snapshot, checksum and obligations.

The code and the data are separately licensed. The data files are distributed inside the
jar; they are not relicensed by the MIT license. `withoutBundledLexicon()` is a runtime
mode that does not load the data. It does not remove the data from the jar and does not
remove the CC BY-SA 3.0 attribution or redistribution obligations.

